[2026-03-04T21:16:57.077Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EzcZPajUVsgmVWmeuYgvGn","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Let me create a comprehensive exploration report for you with all the details about the todo-app.\n\n## Todo-App Comprehensive Exploration Report\n\nI've thoroughly analyzed the todo-app. Here's everything you need to understand:\n\n---\n\n### 1. COMPONENT STRUCTURE\n\nThe app has a clean, hierarchical component structure:\n\n**Main Entry Point**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/src/main.tsx`\n- Wraps the app with Redux Provider and StrictMode\n- Renders App -> MainTodoList -> All other components\n\n**Key Components** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/components/`):\n\n1. **Header.tsx** - Displays app title and incomplete todo count\n   - Uses `useAppSelector` to get items and count incomplete todos\n   - data-testid: \"header\"\n   - Displays: `data-testid=\"app-title\"` and `data-testid=\"todo-count\"`\n\n2. **FilterBar.tsx** - Filter controls and clear completed button\n   - Three filter buttons: 'All', 'Active', 'Completed'\n   - Each has `data-testid=\"filter-{value}\"` (filter-all, filter-active, filter-completed)\n   - **Clear Completed button**: `data-testid=\"clear-completed\"`\n   - Uses dispatch to call `setFilter()` and `clearCompleted()`\n   - Clear button only shows if `hasCompleted` (checked via selector)\n   - Container: `data-testid=\"filter-bar\"`\n\n3. **TodoList.tsx** - Renders filtered and sorted todos\n   - Contains `filterTodos()` and `sortTodos()` helper functions\n   - Filters based on Redux state `state.todos.filter` ('all', 'active', 'completed')\n   - Sorts based on Redux state `state.todos.sort` ('newest', 'oldest', 'priority', 'due_date')\n   - Shows loading state or empty state messages\n   - Container: `data-testid=\"todo-list\"`\n\n4. **TodoItem.tsx** - Individual todo row\n   - **data-testid attributes**:\n     - `data-testid=\"todo-item\"` - Main container\n     - `data-testid=\"todo-checkbox\"` - Checkbox button\n     - `data-testid=\"todo-text\"` - Title text (clickable for edit)\n     - `data-testid=\"priority-badge\"` - Priority label\n     - `data-testid=\"due-date\"` - Due date display\n     - `data-testid=\"delete-button\"` - Delete button (appears on hover)\n   - Displays strikethrough for completed todos\n   - Has opacity-60 class for completed items\n   - Delete button is opacity-0 by default, shows on hover\n\n5. **FilterBar.tsx & AddTodo.tsx** - Simple components:\n   - AddTodo: Has `data-testid=\"add-todo\"` and `data-testid=\"add-todo-input\"`\n   - Accepts Enter key to add todo\n\n6. **SortDropdown.tsx** - Sort selector dropdown\n   - Has `data-testid=\"sort-dropdown\"` on container\n   - Has `data-testid=\"sort-dropdown-trigger\"` on button\n   - Has `data-testid=\"sort-dropdown-menu\"` on menu\n   - Each option: `data-testid=\"sort-option-{value}\"`\n\n7. **EditTodoModal.tsx** - Modal for editing todos\n   - Modal data-testid: \"edit-modal-backdrop\" (backdrop)\n   - Modal data-testid: \"edit-modal\" (actual modal)\n   - Fields:\n     - `data-testid=\"edit-title\"`\n     - `data-testid=\"edit-priority\"`\n     - `data-testid=\"edit-due-date\"`\n     - `data-testid=\"edit-notes\"`\n   - Buttons: \"edit-save\", \"edit-cancel\"\n   - Error display: \"title-error\"\n\n---\n\n### 2. REDUX STORE & SLICE SETUP\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/src/store/`\n\n**Store Configuration** (`index.ts`):\n```typescript\n- Single reducer: todosReducer from todosSlice\n- RootState type exported for selectors\n- AppDispatch type for dispatch typing\n```\n\n**Todos Slice** (`todosSlice.ts`) - Comprehensive Redux setup:\n\n**State Shape**:\n```typescript\ninterface TodosState {\n  items: Todo[]           // Array of all todos\n  loading: boolean        // Loading state\n  error: string | null    // Error messages\n  filter: FilterType      // 'all' | 'active' | 'completed'\n  sort: SortType         // 'newest' | 'oldest' | 'priority' | 'due_date'\n}\n\nInitial: {\n  items: [],\n  loading: false,\n  error: null,\n  filter: 'all',        // Default to showing all\n  sort: 'newest',       // Default to newest first\n}\n```\n\n**Async Thunks** (API calls):\n\n1. **fetchTodos()** - GET `/.netlify/functions/todos`\n   - Returns all todos ordered by created_at DESC\n\n2. **addTodo(title: string)** - POST `/.netlify/functions/todos`\n   - Body: `{ title }`\n   - Returns: new Todo\n\n3. **toggleTodo({ id, completed })** - PUT `/.netlify/functions/todos/{id}`\n   - Body: `{ completed: boolean }`\n   - Returns: updated Todo\n\n4. **updateTodo({ id, updates })** - PUT `/.netlify/functions/todos/{id}`\n   - Body: partial Todo fields\n   - Returns: updated Todo\n\n5. **deleteTodo(id)** - DELETE `/.netlify/functions/todos/{id}`\n   - Returns: the deleted id\n\n6. **clearCompleted()** - DELETE `/.netlify/functions/todos?completed=true`\n   - Deletes all completed todos\n   - Returns: array of deleted todos\n\n**Reducers** (Synchronous):\n```typescript\nsetFilter(state, action) - Sets filter to 'all' | 'active' | 'completed'\nsetSort(state, action)   - Sets sort to any SortType\n```\n\n**Extra Reducers** (Handle async thunk states):\n- `fetchTodos.fulfilled` - Sets items to payload\n- `addTodo.fulfilled` - Unshifts new todo to items (prepends)\n- `toggleTodo.fulfilled` - Updates item in array\n- `updateTodo.fulfilled` - Updates item in array\n- `deleteTodo.fulfilled` - Removes item from array by id\n- **clearCompleted.fulfilled** - Filters out completed todos: `state.items = state.items.filter((t) => !t.completed)`\n\n**Hooks** (`hooks.ts`):\n- `useAppDispatch` - Typed dispatch hook\n- `useAppSelector` - Typed selector hook\n\n---\n\n### 3. FILTERING & CLEAR-COMPLETED MECHANICS\n\n**How Filtering Works**:\n\n1. **Redux State Storage**:\n   - Filter value stored in `state.todos.filter`\n   - Changed via `dispatch(setFilter(value))`\n\n2. **Client-Side Filtering** (in TodoList component):\n```typescript\nfunction filterTodos(todos: Todo[], filter: FilterType): Todo[] {\n  switch (filter) {\n    case 'active':\n      return todos.filter((t) => !t.completed)\n    case 'completed':\n      return todos.filter((t) => t.completed)\n    default:\n      return todos  // 'all'\n  }\n}\n```\n\n3. **Rendering Pipeline**:\n   - Get all items from `state.todos.items`\n   - Apply filter: `filterTodos(items, filter)`\n   - Apply sort: `sortTodos(filtered, sort)`\n   - Render sorted/filtered list\n\n**How Clear Completed Works**:\n\n1. **Button Visibility**:\n   - FilterBar checks: `hasCompleted = state.todos.items.some((t) => t.completed)`\n   - Button only renders if `hasCompleted` is true\n   - data-testid: \"clear-completed\"\n\n2. **Dispatch Action**:\n   - `onClick={() => dispatch(clearCompleted())}`\n   - Calls async thunk that hits: `DELETE /.netlify/functions/todos?completed=true`\n\n3. **API Endpoint Response** (netlify/functions/todos.ts):\n```typescript\nif (completedParam === 'true') {\n  const rows = await sql`DELETE FROM todos WHERE completed = true RETURNING *`\n  return new Response(JSON.stringify(rows), { status: 200, headers })\n}\n```\n\n4. **Redux Update**:\n   - `clearCompleted.fulfilled` reducer:\n   ```typescript\n   state.items = state.items.filter((t) => !t.completed)\n   ```\n   - Removes all completed todos from state\n\n5. **UI Updates**:\n   - Items list re-renders (showing only active todos)\n   - Header updates todo count\n   - Clear Completed button may disappear (if no completed todos remain)\n\n---\n\n### 4. DATA-TESTID ATTRIBUTES REFERENCE\n\n**Filter Bar & Controls**:\n- `filter-bar` - Container for all filters\n- `filter-all` - \"All\" filter button\n- `filter-active` - \"Active\" filter button\n- `filter-completed` - \"Completed\" filter button\n- `clear-completed` - \"Clear Completed\" button\n\n**Todo Item Display**:\n- `todo-item` - Individual todo container\n- `todo-checkbox` - Checkbox button\n- `todo-text` - Title text (clickable)\n- `priority-badge` - Priority label (High/Medium/Low)\n- `due-date` - Due date label (Today/Tomorrow/Overdue/Date)\n- `delete-button` - Delete button\n\n**Other Components**:\n- `header` - Header container\n- `app-title` - \"Todo App\" title text\n- `todo-count` - Incomplete items count\n- `add-todo` - Add todo container\n- `add-todo-input` - Input field\n- `todo-list` - Todo list container\n- `sort-dropdown` - Sort dropdown container\n- `sort-dropdown-trigger` - Sort button\n- `sort-dropdown-menu` - Dropdown menu\n- `sort-option-{value}` - Individual sort options\n\n**Edit Modal**:\n- `edit-modal-backdrop` - Backdrop overlay\n- `edit-modal` - Modal container\n- `edit-title` - Title input\n- `edit-priority` - Priority dropdown\n- `edit-due-date` - Due date input\n- `edit-notes` - Notes textarea\n- `edit-save` - Save button\n- `edit-cancel` - Cancel button\n- `title-error` - Error message\n\n---\n\n### 5. TEST FIXTURES FILE\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/tests/fixtures.ts`\n\n```typescript\n// Extends Playwright's base test fixture\nexport const test = base.extend({\n  page: async ({ page }, use) => {\n    // Setup: Seed database before each test\n    const databaseUrl = process.env.TEST_DATABASE_URL || process.env.DATABASE_URL\n    if (databaseUrl) {\n      const sql = neon(databaseUrl)\n      await sql`TRUNCATE TABLE todos`\n      // Insert test data\n      await sql`\n        INSERT INTO todos (title, completed, priority, due_date, notes) VALUES\n        ('Buy groceries', false, 'high', '2026-03-10', 'Milk, eggs, bread'),\n        ('Walk the dog', false, 'medium', NULL, NULL),\n        ('Read a book', true, 'low', NULL, 'Finish chapter 5'),\n        ('Clean the house', false, 'medium', '2026-03-07', NULL),\n        ('Finish project report', true, 'high', '2026-03-05', 'Final review needed')\n      `\n    }\n    await use(page)\n  },\n})\n\nexport { expect } from '@playwright/test'\n```\n\n**Seed Data** (5 todos):\n- 3 Active: Buy groceries (high, due 2026-03-10), Walk the dog (medium), Clean the house (medium, due 2026-03-07)\n- 2 Completed: Read a book (low), Finish project report (high, due 2026-03-05)\n\n---\n\n### 6. PLAYWRIGHT CONFIG\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\n- testDir: './tests'\n- fullyParallel: true\n- forbidOnly: !!process.env.CI (forbid .only in CI)\n- retries: 0\n- timeout: 60000\n- actionTimeout: 15000\n- navigationTimeout: 30000\n\nbaseURL: process.env.BASE_URL || 'http://localhost:8888'\nProject: chromium (Desktop Chrome)\n\nReporters:\n- @replayio/playwright (if available)\n- json (test-results/results.json)\n- list\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7. SEED DATA SETUP\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n\n**Functions**:\n\n1. **seedDatabase(databaseUrl)**:\n   - Inserts the 5 test todos\n   - Same data as fixtures.ts\n\n2. **truncateAllTables(databaseUrl)**:\n   - Clears todos table\n\n3. **resetDatabase(databaseUrl)**:\n   - Combines truncate + seed\n   - Ensures clean state\n\n---\n\n### 8. NETLIFY FUNCTIONS (API ENDPOINTS)\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/netlify/functions/`\n\n**todos.ts** - Main API handler:\n\n```\nGET /.netlify/functions/todos\n  Returns: All todos sorted by created_at DESC\n\nPOST /.netlify/functions/todos\n  Body: { title, priority?, due_date?, notes? }\n  Returns: Created todo with id, timestamps\n\nPUT /.netlify/functions/todos/{id}\n  Body: Partial updates (title, completed, priority, due_date, notes)\n  Returns: Updated todo\n\nDELETE /.netlify/functions/todos/{id}\n  Returns: Deleted todo object\n\nDELETE /.netlify/functions/todos?completed=true\n  Clears all completed todos\n  Returns: Array of deleted todos\n```\n\n**db.ts** - Database connection:\n```typescript\nexport function getSql() {\n  return neon(process.env.DATABASE_URL!)\n}\n```\nUses Neon serverless PostgreSQL driver\n\n---\n\n### 9. SCRIPTS/TEST.TS FILE\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/scripts/test.ts` (445 lines)\n\n**Complete Test Workflow**:\n\n1. **Setup**:\n   - Load environment variables from .env\n   - Kill stale netlify/vite processes\n   - Clean up old Neon ephemeral branches\n\n2. **Database Preparation**:\n   - Create ephemeral Neon branch (isolated test DB)\n   - Initialize schema via `initSchema()`\n   - Seed database via `seedDatabase()`\n\n3. **Development Server**:\n   - Start `netlify dev` on port 8888\n   - Wait for server ready signal\n   - Set TEST_DATABASE_URL for test fixtures\n\n4. **Reset Before Tests**:\n   - Call `resetDatabase()` to clean/reseed\n\n5. **Run Playwright**:\n   - Execute: `npx playwright test {testFile}`\n   - With TEST_DATABASE_URL and BASE_URL env vars\n   - Single worker, no retries\n\n6. **Parse Results**:\n   - Read test-results/results.json\n   - Count passed, failed, skipped\n\n7. **Handle Failures**:\n   - Parse Replay recordings log\n   - Upload longest-duration failed recording\n   - Write metadata to logs/test-run-{n}.log\n\n8. **Cleanup**:\n   - Kill netlify dev process\n   - Delete ephemeral Neon branch\n   - Remove replay recordings\n\n9. **Output**:\n   - Print summary: \"X passed, Y failed, Z skipped\"\n   - Include recording ID if uploaded\n   - Exit with Playwright's exit code\n\n---\n\n### 10. KEY DATA TYPES\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/src/types.ts`\n\n```typescript\nexport interface Todo {\n  id: string\n  title: string\n  completed: boolean\n  priority: 'low' | 'medium' | 'high'\n  due_date: string | null      // ISO date string\n  notes: string | null\n  created_at: string           // ISO datetime\n  updated_at: string           // ISO datetime\n}\n\nexport type FilterType = 'all' | 'active' | 'completed'\nexport type SortType = 'newest' | 'oldest' | 'priority' | 'due_date'\n```\n\n---\n\n### 11. DATABASE SCHEMA\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/scripts/schema.ts`\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE todos (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\n  title TEXT NOT NULL,\n  completed BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,\n  priority TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'medium',\n  due_date DATE,\n  notes TEXT,\n  created_at TIMESTAMP NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),\n  updated_at TIMESTAMP NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()\n)\n\nIndexes:\n- idx_todos_created_at (created_at DESC)\n- idx_todos_completed (completed)\n```\n\n---\n\n### 12. COMPLETE FILE MANIFEST\n\n```\n/repo/apps/todo-app/\n├── src/\n│   ├── main.tsx                    (Redux Provider setup)\n│   ├── App.tsx                     (App entry point)\n│   ├── types.ts                    (Todo, FilterType, SortType)\n│   ├── index.css                   (Tailwind + styles)\n│   ├── components/\n│   │   ├── Header.tsx              (Title + todo count)\n│   │   ├── AddTodo.tsx             (Input field)\n│   │   ├── FilterBar.tsx           (Filter + Clear button)\n│   │   ├── TodoList.tsx            (Filter + sort logic)\n│   │   ├── TodoItem.tsx            (Individual todo)\n│   │   ├── SortDropdown.tsx        (Sort selector)\n│   │   └── EditTodoModal.tsx       (Edit form in modal)\n│   ├── pages/\n│   │   └── MainTodoList.tsx        (Main layout + state)\n│   └── store/\n│       ├── index.ts                (Store config)\n│       ├── hooks.ts                (useAppDispatch, useAppSelector)\n│       └── todosSlice.ts           (Reducers + async thunks)\n├── tests/\n│   ├── fixtures.ts                 (Test setup + seed data)\n│   ├── filter-bar.spec.ts          (Filter tests)\n│   ├── todo-list.spec.ts           (Todo item tests)\n│   ├── header-add-todo.spec.ts     (Header + add tests)\n│   ├── edit-todo-modal.spec.ts     (Modal tests)\n│   └── sort-dropdown.spec.ts       (Sort tests)\n├── netlify/functions/\n│   ├── todos.ts                    (API handler: CRUD + clear)\n│   └── db.ts                       (Neon DB connection)\n├── scripts/\n│   ├── test.ts                     (Complete test orchestration)\n│   ├── schema.ts                   (Create DB tables)\n│   ├── seed-db.ts                  (Insert/reset data)\n│   ├── deploy.ts                   (Deployment script)\n│   └── check.ts                    (Pre-commit checks)\n├── playwright.config.ts            (Playwright setup)\n├── package.json                    (Dependencies)\n├── vite.config.ts                  (Vite build config)\n├── tsconfig.json                   (TypeScript config)\n└── .env                            (Environment variables)\n```\n\nThis comprehensive breakdown should give you everything you need to understand the todo-app's architecture, filtering system, and how the clear-completed feature works!"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a4662cc5f0042824c (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 48897\ntool_uses: 31\nduration_ms: 51648</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"52368737-6ec8-4ea8-bd8c-d8bae0c12160","uuid":"f027364c-12bc-4510-8e65-b859f80933ce","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Explore the todo-app in /repo/apps/todo-app. I need to understand:\n1. The component structure - especially filter bar, todo list components\n2. The Redux store/slice setup - how filtering works\n3. The data-testid attributes used (filter-bar, filter-all, filter-active, filter-completed, clear-completed, todo-item, todo-checkbox, todo-text)\n4. The test fixtures file at tests/fixtures.ts or tests/fixtures/index.ts\n5. The playwright config\n6. The seed data setup\n7. The netlify functions (API endpoints)\n8. The scripts/test.ts file\n\nBe thorough - I need to understand how filtering and clear-completed work.","agentId":"a4662cc5f0042824c","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Let me create a comprehensive exploration report for you with all the details about the todo-app.\n\n## Todo-App Comprehensive Exploration Report\n\nI've thoroughly analyzed the todo-app. Here's everything you need to understand:\n\n---\n\n### 1. COMPONENT STRUCTURE\n\nThe app has a clean, hierarchical component structure:\n\n**Main Entry Point**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/src/main.tsx`\n- Wraps the app with Redux Provider and StrictMode\n- Renders App -> MainTodoList -> All other components\n\n**Key Components** (`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/components/`):\n\n1. **Header.tsx** - Displays app title and incomplete todo count\n   - Uses `useAppSelector` to get items and count incomplete todos\n   - data-testid: \"header\"\n   - Displays: `data-testid=\"app-title\"` and `data-testid=\"todo-count\"`\n\n2. **FilterBar.tsx** - Filter controls and clear completed button\n   - Three filter buttons: 'All', 'Active', 'Completed'\n   - Each has `data-testid=\"filter-{value}\"` (filter-all, filter-active, filter-completed)\n   - **Clear Completed button**: `data-testid=\"clear-completed\"`\n   - Uses dispatch to call `setFilter()` and `clearCompleted()`\n   - Clear button only shows if `hasCompleted` (checked via selector)\n   - Container: `data-testid=\"filter-bar\"`\n\n3. **TodoList.tsx** - Renders filtered and sorted todos\n   - Contains `filterTodos()` and `sortTodos()` helper functions\n   - Filters based on Redux state `state.todos.filter` ('all', 'active', 'completed')\n   - Sorts based on Redux state `state.todos.sort` ('newest', 'oldest', 'priority', 'due_date')\n   - Shows loading state or empty state messages\n   - Container: `data-testid=\"todo-list\"`\n\n4. **TodoItem.tsx** - Individual todo row\n   - **data-testid attributes**:\n     - `data-testid=\"todo-item\"` - Main container\n     - `data-testid=\"todo-checkbox\"` - Checkbox button\n     - `data-testid=\"todo-text\"` - Title text (clickable for edit)\n     - `data-testid=\"priority-badge\"` - Priority label\n     - `data-testid=\"due-date\"` - Due date display\n     - `data-testid=\"delete-button\"` - Delete button (appears on hover)\n   - Displays strikethrough for completed todos\n   - Has opacity-60 class for completed items\n   - Delete button is opacity-0 by default, shows on hover\n\n5. **FilterBar.tsx & AddTodo.tsx** - Simple components:\n   - AddTodo: Has `data-testid=\"add-todo\"` and `data-testid=\"add-todo-input\"`\n   - Accepts Enter key to add todo\n\n6. **SortDropdown.tsx** - Sort selector dropdown\n   - Has `data-testid=\"sort-dropdown\"` on container\n   - Has `data-testid=\"sort-dropdown-trigger\"` on button\n   - Has `data-testid=\"sort-dropdown-menu\"` on menu\n   - Each option: `data-testid=\"sort-option-{value}\"`\n\n7. **EditTodoModal.tsx** - Modal for editing todos\n   - Modal data-testid: \"edit-modal-backdrop\" (backdrop)\n   - Modal data-testid: \"edit-modal\" (actual modal)\n   - Fields:\n     - `data-testid=\"edit-title\"`\n     - `data-testid=\"edit-priority\"`\n     - `data-testid=\"edit-due-date\"`\n     - `data-testid=\"edit-notes\"`\n   - Buttons: \"edit-save\", \"edit-cancel\"\n   - Error display: \"title-error\"\n\n---\n\n### 2. REDUX STORE & SLICE SETUP\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/src/store/`\n\n**Store Configuration** (`index.ts`):\n```typescript\n- Single reducer: todosReducer from todosSlice\n- RootState type exported for selectors\n- AppDispatch type for dispatch typing\n```\n\n**Todos Slice** (`todosSlice.ts`) - Comprehensive Redux setup:\n\n**State Shape**:\n```typescript\ninterface TodosState {\n  items: Todo[]           // Array of all todos\n  loading: boolean        // Loading state\n  error: string | null    // Error messages\n  filter: FilterType      // 'all' | 'active' | 'completed'\n  sort: SortType         // 'newest' | 'oldest' | 'priority' | 'due_date'\n}\n\nInitial: {\n  items: [],\n  loading: false,\n  error: null,\n  filter: 'all',        // Default to showing all\n  sort: 'newest',       // Default to newest first\n}\n```\n\n**Async Thunks** (API calls):\n\n1. **fetchTodos()** - GET `/.netlify/functions/todos`\n   - Returns all todos ordered by created_at DESC\n\n2. **addTodo(title: string)** - POST `/.netlify/functions/todos`\n   - Body: `{ title }`\n   - Returns: new Todo\n\n3. **toggleTodo({ id, completed })** - PUT `/.netlify/functions/todos/{id}`\n   - Body: `{ completed: boolean }`\n   - Returns: updated Todo\n\n4. **updateTodo({ id, updates })** - PUT `/.netlify/functions/todos/{id}`\n   - Body: partial Todo fields\n   - Returns: updated Todo\n\n5. **deleteTodo(id)** - DELETE `/.netlify/functions/todos/{id}`\n   - Returns: the deleted id\n\n6. **clearCompleted()** - DELETE `/.netlify/functions/todos?completed=true`\n   - Deletes all completed todos\n   - Returns: array of deleted todos\n\n**Reducers** (Synchronous):\n```typescript\nsetFilter(state, action) - Sets filter to 'all' | 'active' | 'completed'\nsetSort(state, action)   - Sets sort to any SortType\n```\n\n**Extra Reducers** (Handle async thunk states):\n- `fetchTodos.fulfilled` - Sets items to payload\n- `addTodo.fulfilled` - Unshifts new todo to items (prepends)\n- `toggleTodo.fulfilled` - Updates item in array\n- `updateTodo.fulfilled` - Updates item in array\n- `deleteTodo.fulfilled` - Removes item from array by id\n- **clearCompleted.fulfilled** - Filters out completed todos: `state.items = state.items.filter((t) => !t.completed)`\n\n**Hooks** (`hooks.ts`):\n- `useAppDispatch` - Typed dispatch hook\n- `useAppSelector` - Typed selector hook\n\n---\n\n### 3. FILTERING & CLEAR-COMPLETED MECHANICS\n\n**How Filtering Works**:\n\n1. **Redux State Storage**:\n   - Filter value stored in `state.todos.filter`\n   - Changed via `dispatch(setFilter(value))`\n\n2. **Client-Side Filtering** (in TodoList component):\n```typescript\nfunction filterTodos(todos: Todo[], filter: FilterType): Todo[] {\n  switch (filter) {\n    case 'active':\n      return todos.filter((t) => !t.completed)\n    case 'completed':\n      return todos.filter((t) => t.completed)\n    default:\n      return todos  // 'all'\n  }\n}\n```\n\n3. **Rendering Pipeline**:\n   - Get all items from `state.todos.items`\n   - Apply filter: `filterTodos(items, filter)`\n   - Apply sort: `sortTodos(filtered, sort)`\n   - Render sorted/filtered list\n\n**How Clear Completed Works**:\n\n1. **Button Visibility**:\n   - FilterBar checks: `hasCompleted = state.todos.items.some((t) => t.completed)`\n   - Button only renders if `hasCompleted` is true\n   - data-testid: \"clear-completed\"\n\n2. **Dispatch Action**:\n   - `onClick={() => dispatch(clearCompleted())}`\n   - Calls async thunk that hits: `DELETE /.netlify/functions/todos?completed=true`\n\n3. **API Endpoint Response** (netlify/functions/todos.ts):\n```typescript\nif (completedParam === 'true') {\n  const rows = await sql`DELETE FROM todos WHERE completed = true RETURNING *`\n  return new Response(JSON.stringify(rows), { status: 200, headers })\n}\n```\n\n4. **Redux Update**:\n   - `clearCompleted.fulfilled` reducer:\n   ```typescript\n   state.items = state.items.filter((t) => !t.completed)\n   ```\n   - Removes all completed todos from state\n\n5. **UI Updates**:\n   - Items list re-renders (showing only active todos)\n   - Header updates todo count\n   - Clear Completed button may disappear (if no completed todos remain)\n\n---\n\n### 4. DATA-TESTID ATTRIBUTES REFERENCE\n\n**Filter Bar & Controls**:\n- `filter-bar` - Container for all filters\n- `filter-all` - \"All\" filter button\n- `filter-active` - \"Active\" filter button\n- `filter-completed` - \"Completed\" filter button\n- `clear-completed` - \"Clear Completed\" button\n\n**Todo Item Display**:\n- `todo-item` - Individual todo container\n- `todo-checkbox` - Checkbox button\n- `todo-text` - Title text (clickable)\n- `priority-badge` - Priority label (High/Medium/Low)\n- `due-date` - Due date label (Today/Tomorrow/Overdue/Date)\n- `delete-button` - Delete button\n\n**Other Components**:\n- `header` - Header container\n- `app-title` - \"Todo App\" title text\n- `todo-count` - Incomplete items count\n- `add-todo` - Add todo container\n- `add-todo-input` - Input field\n- `todo-list` - Todo list container\n- `sort-dropdown` - Sort dropdown container\n- `sort-dropdown-trigger` - Sort button\n- `sort-dropdown-menu` - Dropdown menu\n- `sort-option-{value}` - Individual sort options\n\n**Edit Modal**:\n- `edit-modal-backdrop` - Backdrop overlay\n- `edit-modal` - Modal container\n- `edit-title` - Title input\n- `edit-priority` - Priority dropdown\n- `edit-due-date` - Due date input\n- `edit-notes` - Notes textarea\n- `edit-save` - Save button\n- `edit-cancel` - Cancel button\n- `title-error` - Error message\n\n---\n\n### 5. TEST FIXTURES FILE\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/tests/fixtures.ts`\n\n```typescript\n// Extends Playwright's base test fixture\nexport const test = base.extend({\n  page: async ({ page }, use) => {\n    // Setup: Seed database before each test\n    const databaseUrl = process.env.TEST_DATABASE_URL || process.env.DATABASE_URL\n    if (databaseUrl) {\n      const sql = neon(databaseUrl)\n      await sql`TRUNCATE TABLE todos`\n      // Insert test data\n      await sql`\n        INSERT INTO todos (title, completed, priority, due_date, notes) VALUES\n        ('Buy groceries', false, 'high', '2026-03-10', 'Milk, eggs, bread'),\n        ('Walk the dog', false, 'medium', NULL, NULL),\n        ('Read a book', true, 'low', NULL, 'Finish chapter 5'),\n        ('Clean the house', false, 'medium', '2026-03-07', NULL),\n        ('Finish project report', true, 'high', '2026-03-05', 'Final review needed')\n      `\n    }\n    await use(page)\n  },\n})\n\nexport { expect } from '@playwright/test'\n```\n\n**Seed Data** (5 todos):\n- 3 Active: Buy groceries (high, due 2026-03-10), Walk the dog (medium), Clean the house (medium, due 2026-03-07)\n- 2 Completed: Read a book (low), Finish project report (high, due 2026-03-05)\n\n---\n\n### 6. PLAYWRIGHT CONFIG\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\n- testDir: './tests'\n- fullyParallel: true\n- forbidOnly: !!process.env.CI (forbid .only in CI)\n- retries: 0\n- timeout: 60000\n- actionTimeout: 15000\n- navigationTimeout: 30000\n\nbaseURL: process.env.BASE_URL || 'http://localhost:8888'\nProject: chromium (Desktop Chrome)\n\nReporters:\n- @replayio/playwright (if available)\n- json (test-results/results.json)\n- list\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7. SEED DATA SETUP\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n\n**Functions**:\n\n1. **seedDatabase(databaseUrl)**:\n   - Inserts the 5 test todos\n   - Same data as fixtures.ts\n\n2. **truncateAllTables(databaseUrl)**:\n   - Clears todos table\n\n3. **resetDatabase(databaseUrl)**:\n   - Combines truncate + seed\n   - Ensures clean state\n\n---\n\n### 8. NETLIFY FUNCTIONS (API ENDPOINTS)\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/netlify/functions/`\n\n**todos.ts** - Main API handler:\n\n```\nGET /.netlify/functions/todos\n  Returns: All todos sorted by created_at DESC\n\nPOST /.netlify/functions/todos\n  Body: { title, priority?, due_date?, notes? }\n  Returns: Created todo with id, timestamps\n\nPUT /.netlify/functions/todos/{id}\n  Body: Partial updates (title, completed, priority, due_date, notes)\n  Returns: Updated todo\n\nDELETE /.netlify/functions/todos/{id}\n  Returns: Deleted todo object\n\nDELETE /.netlify/functions/todos?completed=true\n  Clears all completed todos\n  Returns: Array of deleted todos\n```\n\n**db.ts** - Database connection:\n```typescript\nexport function getSql() {\n  return neon(process.env.DATABASE_URL!)\n}\n```\nUses Neon serverless PostgreSQL driver\n\n---\n\n### 9. SCRIPTS/TEST.TS FILE\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/scripts/test.ts` (445 lines)\n\n**Complete Test Workflow**:\n\n1. **Setup**:\n   - Load environment variables from .env\n   - Kill stale netlify/vite processes\n   - Clean up old Neon ephemeral branches\n\n2. **Database Preparation**:\n   - Create ephemeral Neon branch (isolated test DB)\n   - Initialize schema via `initSchema()`\n   - Seed database via `seedDatabase()`\n\n3. **Development Server**:\n   - Start `netlify dev` on port 8888\n   - Wait for server ready signal\n   - Set TEST_DATABASE_URL for test fixtures\n\n4. **Reset Before Tests**:\n   - Call `resetDatabase()` to clean/reseed\n\n5. **Run Playwright**:\n   - Execute: `npx playwright test {testFile}`\n   - With TEST_DATABASE_URL and BASE_URL env vars\n   - Single worker, no retries\n\n6. **Parse Results**:\n   - Read test-results/results.json\n   - Count passed, failed, skipped\n\n7. **Handle Failures**:\n   - Parse Replay recordings log\n   - Upload longest-duration failed recording\n   - Write metadata to logs/test-run-{n}.log\n\n8. **Cleanup**:\n   - Kill netlify dev process\n   - Delete ephemeral Neon branch\n   - Remove replay recordings\n\n9. **Output**:\n   - Print summary: \"X passed, Y failed, Z skipped\"\n   - Include recording ID if uploaded\n   - Exit with Playwright's exit code\n\n---\n\n### 10. KEY DATA TYPES\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/src/types.ts`\n\n```typescript\nexport interface Todo {\n  id: string\n  title: string\n  completed: boolean\n  priority: 'low' | 'medium' | 'high'\n  due_date: string | null      // ISO date string\n  notes: string | null\n  created_at: string           // ISO datetime\n  updated_at: string           // ISO datetime\n}\n\nexport type FilterType = 'all' | 'active' | 'completed'\nexport type SortType = 'newest' | 'oldest' | 'priority' | 'due_date'\n```\n\n---\n\n### 11. DATABASE SCHEMA\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/todo-app/scripts/schema.ts`\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE todos (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\n  title TEXT NOT NULL,\n  completed BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,\n  priority TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'medium',\n  due_date DATE,\n  notes TEXT,\n  created_at TIMESTAMP NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),\n  updated_at TIMESTAMP NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()\n)\n\nIndexes:\n- idx_todos_created_at (created_at DESC)\n- idx_todos_completed (completed)\n```\n\n---\n\n### 12. COMPLETE FILE MANIFEST\n\n```\n/repo/apps/todo-app/\n├── src/\n│   ├── main.tsx                    (Redux Provider setup)\n│   ├── App.tsx                     (App entry point)\n│   ├── types.ts                    (Todo, FilterType, SortType)\n│   ├── index.css                   (Tailwind + styles)\n│   ├── components/\n│   │   ├── Header.tsx              (Title + todo count)\n│   │   ├── AddTodo.tsx             (Input field)\n│   │   ├── FilterBar.tsx           (Filter + Clear button)\n│   │   ├── TodoList.tsx            (Filter + sort logic)\n│   │   ├── TodoItem.tsx            (Individual todo)\n│   │   ├── SortDropdown.tsx        (Sort selector)\n│   │   └── EditTodoModal.tsx       (Edit form in modal)\n│   ├── pages/\n│   │   └── MainTodoList.tsx        (Main layout + state)\n│   └── store/\n│       ├── index.ts                (Store config)\n│       ├── hooks.ts                (useAppDispatch, useAppSelector)\n│       └── todosSlice.ts           (Reducers + async thunks)\n├── tests/\n│   ├── fixtures.ts                 (Test setup + seed data)\n│   ├── filter-bar.spec.ts          (Filter tests)\n│   ├── todo-list.spec.ts           (Todo item tests)\n│   ├── header-add-todo.spec.ts     (Header + add tests)\n│   ├── edit-todo-modal.spec.ts     (Modal tests)\n│   └── sort-dropdown.spec.ts       (Sort tests)\n├── netlify/functions/\n│   ├── todos.ts                    (API handler: CRUD + clear)\n│   └── db.ts                       (Neon DB connection)\n├── scripts/\n│   ├── test.ts                     (Complete test orchestration)\n│   ├── schema.ts                   (Create DB tables)\n│   ├── seed-db.ts                  (Insert/reset data)\n│   ├── deploy.ts                   (Deployment script)\n│   └── check.ts                    (Pre-commit checks)\n├── playwright.config.ts            (Playwright setup)\n├── package.json                    (Dependencies)\n├── vite.config.ts                  (Vite build config)\n├── tsconfig.json                   (TypeScript config)\n└── .env                            (Environment variables)\n```\n\nThis comprehensive breakdown should give you everything you need to understand the todo-app's architecture, filtering system, and how the clear-completed feature works!"}],"totalDurationMs":51648,"totalTokens":48897,"totalToolUseCount":31,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"ca